# Inference is configured centrally — set NEBIUS_API_KEY in the repo-root compute.env (see COMPUTE.md).
#
# Only the hosted configs need inference (configs/*_llm_gemini*, *_llm_groq*, *_llm_closed):
# the 22 scripted configs and the distilgpt2 configs run without any key.
# Hosted models keep the paper's choices:
#   google/gemini-2.5-flash, meta-llama/llama-3.1-8b-instruct, openai/gpt-4o-mini

# Optional, operational:
# COLLUDEBENCH_DEBUG_LLMS=1     print LLM prompts/responses while running
# AUDIT_MANIFEST=...            set automatically by auditor/detectors/external.py when it
# BASELINE_OUTPUT=...           invokes the external-baseline scripts; only set by hand if
#                               you run scripts/run_*_baseline.py directly
